.TH ZDOTS-EVAL 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-eval \- zdots\-eval — run the promptfoo eval suite against the local llama.cpp endpoint.
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-eval --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
zdots-eval — run the promptfoo eval suite against the local llama.cpp endpoint.

LOCAL-ONLY: inference targets 127.0.0.1:11500 (loopback); no cloud keys.

Usage:
  zdots-eval                        # full suite
  zdots-eval --filter-first-n N     # first N tests only
  zdots-eval --filter-pattern PHI   # tests matching pattern
  zdots-eval --no-cache             # bypass promptfoo cache
  zdots-eval -h | --help            # this message

All other flags pass through to `promptfoo eval`. See `npx promptfoo eval --help`.
Override endpoint: ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT=http://192.168.1.10:11500 zdots-eval
.fi
